<title>UK: GECC sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets NZ$100 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY	 FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.69    PAY DATE    03.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  USA	 TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
